{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1b0ed60c-3553-880e-b510-6b234e4b75ea",
  "created_at": "2026-01-23T12:30:35-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Canvassing",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Fernando B. Resendes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Walter Tavares",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:26:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Canvassing Office, Walter Tavares speaking. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:26:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good afternoon. Fernando Resendes here. I had a question about voting, about registering, for a student."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:26:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can help with that. Is this student someone in your family?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:26:36-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, she works for me part-time at the shop. She's up at the college, lives in the dorm. Wants to know if she can register using the campus address. Her family's from out of state, see."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:26:52-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Generally, yes. A student can register where they actually live while they're at school, and that can be a dorm address, as long as that's where they consider home during the school year. She'd fill out the registration form with the dorm address and the room or building details."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:27:13-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. Because I told her, I said, I think you can, but I didn't want to steer her wrong. My sister went to school up in Boston, back in, oh, it must have been ninety-one, and she voted down here the whole time, mailed in, and nobody ever..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:27:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry. I'm wandering. Where was I?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:27:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. You were asking about the dorm address."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:27:41-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, right. The dorm address. And she'd have to give up registration back home, then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:27:48-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "She can only be registered in one place. So if she registers here, her old registration would be canceled. That's something she'd want to think about if she plans to vote at home instead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:28:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. She says she'd rather vote here. She's here nine months a year anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:28:08-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then that makes sense for her."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:28:11-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Now, what's the deadline? Is there a cutoff before an election? I don't know when the next one is, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:28:20-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a cutoff before every election, and it's a few weeks ahead. The exact date depends on which election it is, so she should check the calendar for the next one. I can tell you what's coming up if you hold on a second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:28:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I'll hold."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:28:40-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. [pause] Okay, I'm back. Nothing is on the calendar for this month. The best thing is for her to register now so she's set, and she won't have to worry about a deadline later."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:28:55-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's smart. Get it done early. That's what I always tell her about the inventory too. Do it before you need it. Now, wait, what was I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:29:07-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hang on. I came into the kitchen for something. I was going to get, no, it's gone. I walked in here with the phone and now I can't think what I wanted."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:29:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Happens to everybody. Maybe it'll come back to you once you sit down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:29:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Probably when I hang up. Anyway. Where does she get the form? Does she come to City Hall?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:29:35-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "She can come in to the Canvassing Office during business hours and fill one out here. She can also get the form online and mail it in. She'll need her ID, or the last four digits of her Social Security number, if she doesn't have a license."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:29:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Her ID and the form. And she writes the dorm address."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:30:01-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. If she has questions about the building name or the mailing address, the housing office at the school can help with that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:30:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I'll pass that along. She's in tomorrow morning, so I'll tell her then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:30:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Anything else I can do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:30:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. I appreciate it. Thank you, Walter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:30:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon, and a good weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:30:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
